# issue: none
# notes: One checked warmup precedes one measured query against a long-running server; an exact result check follows.

--- runner
timeout_ms: 60000
environments:
  - target: omnigraph-server
    storage: local-filesystem

--- query
query count_all() { match { $p: Person } return { count($p) as n } }
--- expect unordered
{"n":100}
--- expect shape
n: I64

